@startuml sequence-diagram
title Academic Planner - Sequence Diagram


skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #silver
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #black
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #silver
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #black
skinparam ActorBorderColor #black
autonumber

actor Student
participant App
participant Scheduler
database Database

== Generate study schedule ==

Student -> App : Tap "Generate schedule"
App -> Database : Get tasks, timetable, availability
Database --> App : Data
App -> Scheduler : Create schedule(data)
Scheduler --> App : Study sessions\n(+ warning if work cannot fit)
App -> Database : Save sessions
App --> Student : Show schedule

== Missed session and reschedule ==

Student -> App : Mark session as missed
App -> Database : Save missed session, get remaining work
App -> Scheduler : Reschedule(remaining work)
Scheduler --> App : New study sessions
App -> Database : Replace future sessions
App --> Student : Show updated plan

@enduml